# Read-only tour of a real repository: every panel, then into a commit and its
# files. Nothing depends on what the repository contains, so it runs on any
# copy: .dev-tools/flow-compare.sh --repo . test/flows/repo-tour.flow
repo .
focus "reading: every panel and a commit's files, with the keys"
not "anything that changes the repository (feature-workflow); mouse and scrolling (ui-mouse)"

step 01_start
step 02_files 2
step 03_branches 3
step 04_commits 4
step 05_commit_down j
step 06_commit_files Enter
step 07_back Escape
step 08_stash 5
step 09_help ?
